Unit eleven. Clothes!

2
00:00:03.911 --> 00:00:12.227
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Chanthy. Welcome to C2-EPE Master English, Beginner level!

3
00:00:12.277 --> 00:00:15.586
Hi, Teacher Chanthy! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:15.636 --> 00:00:18.962
Today we learn: Clothes. Let's go!

5
00:00:20.005 --> 00:00:23.605
Shirt. Say it with me. Shirt!

6
00:00:27.065 --> 00:00:30.732
Pants. Say it with me. Pants!

7
00:00:34.229 --> 00:00:37.962
Shoes. Say it with me. Shoes!

8
00:00:41.459 --> 00:00:45.093
Jacket. Say it with me. Jacket!

9
00:00:48.589 --> 00:00:52.023
Hat. Say it with me. Hat!

10
00:00:55.577 --> 00:00:59.360
Wear. Say it with me. Wear!

11
00:01:02.822 --> 00:01:06.806
Comfortable. Say it with me. Comfortable!

12
00:01:10.284 --> 00:01:14.184
Size. Say it with me. Size!

13
00:01:17.714 --> 00:01:21.447
Outfit. Say it with me. Outfit!

14
00:01:25.002 --> 00:01:28.869
Style. Say it with me. Style!

15
00:01:32.290 --> 00:01:42.768
Grammar time! Present continuous for clothes. Listen. I am wearing a jacket. She is wearing shoes.

16
00:01:42.818 --> 00:01:49.073
Your turn. Say it with me. I am wearing a jacket. She is wearing shoes.

17
00:01:54.043 --> 00:02:01.276
I wear a comfortable shirt and pants to school. In cold weather, I put on a jacket and a warm hat.

18
00:02:01.326 --> 00:02:02.919
I like this story!

19
00:02:04.053 --> 00:02:09.400
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:09.450 --> 00:02:10.600
Shoes!

21
00:02:11.599 --> 00:02:16.934
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:16.984 --> 00:02:18.138
Comfortable!

23
00:02:19.020 --> 00:02:26.657
Think and answer. What are you wearing today?

24
00:02:26.707 --> 00:02:27.904
Great answer!

25
00:02:28.974 --> 00:02:33.632
Great work today! See you next time. Goodbye!

26
